{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0443_1000_030iku", "source_sha256": "21ecbd171022efff24b638358164e3d15425ff61087f049593286010c8530ed1", "ja": "わぁ……きれい。\nこんなにいっぱい見えるんだ～♪", "zh": "哇……好漂亮。\n能看到这么多呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0443_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b214ede5e165cb2bee6c675d26383747ecc3d93643e26085a17bae10c08f2d3a", "ja": "お疲れ様、育。\nなんだか楽しそうだけど、なに見てるんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，育。\n看起来好像很开心，你在看什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0443_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "acaa44dafa41d3a576d2519c111724032d03e8f0db37ec6ffa9bd4463a91e2e4", "ja": "雑誌だよ。色んなキャンプ場がのってるの。\n星がとってもきれいに見えるんだって！", "zh": "是杂志哦。上面介绍了各种各样的露营地。\n听说在那里能看到特别漂亮的星星呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0443_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f0494a71f13fcf7f6e701a310808117e57c899747342cad5c9e3afdbb9c9a8fc", "ja": "どれどれ……。おお、本当だ。\n天体観測のオススメスポットを特集してるんだな。", "zh": "我看看……哦，真的。\n这是在介绍适合观星的推荐地点啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0443_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "612412a71eb04e1f601cab9a8265b1461ff10f8400f339bcc51f51c85c50d52d", "ja": "ね、すごいでしょ？\nこの前行ったところも、星がきれいだったけど……。", "zh": "你看，很厉害吧？\n我们之前去的地方，星星也很漂亮，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0443_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "10372783c5be910ef203d4a0b46775e61f151b1754820542d72eb32e88831ecc", "ja": "このキャンプ場も、すごくすてきだよね！\nまた、みんなと一緒に行きたいな～。", "zh": "这个露营地也特别棒呢！\n真想再和大家一起去啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0443_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a4c9cd54460105a9b18537c1f6d0175a305b8d39155877944452baa5f5999107", "ja": "はは、育は天体観測が気に入ったみたいだな。", "zh": "哈哈，看来育很喜欢观测星星啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0443_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "42c797b18a03870d78d9a578967455a2bbb28c705fabe1b47be8412ca3481ec2", "ja": "うん！　だって、すごく楽しかったんだもん♪\nみんなとおしゃべりして、きれいな星を見て……。", "zh": "嗯！因为真的特别开心嘛♪\n和大家聊天，还看了漂亮的星星……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0443_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "034fe40397dc1cf3e3904de858e0c8bd596a73a40ed6463c71061ead9804450c", "ja": "わたし、おうちでも星を見てるんだよ！\nあんまりきれいには見えないけど……。", "zh": "我在家里也会看星星哦！\n虽然没法看得那么清楚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0443_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ebcae6b71df24a4563b76e2262e7de73aec8da50a3f577363129bc7905461373", "ja": "家だと、そうだよな……。\nキャンプ場に比べて、都会は明るいもんな。", "zh": "在家里的话，确实是这样……  \n和露营地比起来，城市里亮多了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0443_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "f0c594a44c475b2502e5fd247bf0e8164af9e5eaf668a529b0d5edb8d6d5283e", "ja": "うん。それとね……\nわたし、この前は途中で寝ちゃったでしょ？", "zh": "嗯。还有啊……\n我上次不是看到一半就睡着了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0443_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "b46d038ee67c0839ff2d0167e44cd662af724140eeb9ff7b796353a7d83d7171", "ja": "だからもう一回、みんなで見に行きたいの。\n今度はちゃーんと、最後まで起きてるんだ！", "zh": "所以我想再和大家一起去看一次。\n这次我一定会好好醒着看到最后！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0443_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a57484e94d7766a14295bd4530f9b059c1f8376a1c676b143606ee5f4aef2354", "ja": "なるほど、それで……。わかった！\nそれじゃキャンプ場で星を見る計画を立ててみるか！", "zh": "原来如此，所以……明白了！  \n那就来计划一下去露营地看星星吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0443_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "659d4834363bfe314ed2521a87a198f7ad4824202e4680a97b09e3f912301550", "ja": "本当！？　{$P$}さん、\nまたキャンプに連れてってくれるの？", "zh": "真的！？{$P$}先生，你还会带我去露营吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0443_1014_p", "source_sha256": "fe8786036e14c6a699362c56855f8efb1c2d3832997189dcec1f5badc76766f1", "ja": "ああ。千早やみんなにも声をかけてみよう。\nそうだ！　雑誌に載ってるキャンプ場に行ってみよう！", "zh": "啊。也去问问千早和大家要不要一起吧。\n对了！去杂志上刊登的露营地看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0443_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "8b70827896471dd67e12d07e5bb4ff17fbe585797f3c34814ece06d58f9daf6d", "ja": "やった♪　ありがとう{$P$}さん！\nえへへ。今から楽しみだな～♪", "zh": "太好了♪ 谢谢你，{$P$}先生！\n诶嘿嘿，我现在就开始期待了呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
